<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/11/eng@/~cl_4__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "in subsection (1) by inserting after the word \"airport\" the words \"or otherwise\"; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/11/eng@/~cl_4__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/11/eng@/~cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/11/eng@> .
